{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/9c6d95d4f1cb42593fa679178c698778.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/d58af4a0c940c66f7d37ce0676ea2192.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/e5ed5d392b2677ea712440b903969a07.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/5108f141d1a688b1cef3811e0687c62e.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/33bf1232bedb163822700c8e6d47247a.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/b42aa5846665fb1ca678f59e084e84a1.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/fe20396d4a25e7a5adaa65216c2692a3.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;<strong><u>In the beginning was the Void. Then came the Click. Then came everything</u></strong>.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/7074efb7e1d3beb53e625816085ff645.avif?t=1773972126\" width=420 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Foundry</strong> is an incremental game built on cosmic mythology. Before time or thought existed, a single act of creation \u2014 a Click \u2014 shattered infinite stillness and forged the First Cube. Six faces, twelve edges, eight vertices: each encoding fundamental laws of reality. From one came two, from two came four, and from four came the cascade of all existence. Now <strong>you</strong> stand at the Foundry \u2014 a nexus point in creation itself \u2014 and the Architects are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/e5ed5d392b2677ea712440b903969a07.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>The First Click \u2014 and the Cascade That Follows</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/e5ed5d392b2677ea712440b903969a07.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click echoes the original act of creation. Build combo multipliers up to <strong>10x</strong>, trigger critical hits, and feel the rhythm of a universe expanding beneath your fingertips. But a Creator cannot click forever \u2014 that is why the Foundry builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command <strong>generators</strong> across escalating tiers, from the humble <i>Assembler Static</i> to the transcendent <i>Godforge Terminus</i> and the incomprehensible <i>Dimensional Nexus</i>. Each machine is a step along the <strong>Eight Ages of Ascension</strong> \u2014 from Assembly, through Synthesis and Transcendence, to Omnipotence and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/9c6d95d4f1cb42593fa679178c698778.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Upgrades \u2014 Choose Your Path Through Creation</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/9c6d95d4f1cb42593fa679178c698778.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Foundry does not reward brute force alone. Over <strong>500 upgrades</strong> branch across <strong>20+ specialization paths</strong> with layered prerequisites. Amplify your clicks, empower specific generators, or unlock synergies that fuse active and passive income into something greater. Every choice shapes the Creator you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/33bf1232bedb163822700c8e6d47247a.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Prestige \u2014 Metamorphosis, Not Loss</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/33bf1232bedb163822700c8e6d47247a.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The caterpillar does not mourn its cocoon. Why do you mourn your Cubes?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your production eclipses mortal scale, the Foundry offers <strong>Prestige</strong> \u2014 a metamorphosis. Sacrifice cubes and generators to earn <strong>Prestige Points</strong> and unlock <strong>187 permanent upgrades</strong> across multiple tiers. Your mastery and knowledge carry forward. Each cycle begins faster, climbs higher, reaches further. The first Prestige is fear. The tenth is routine. The hundredth is... something else entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/b42aa5846665fb1ca678f59e084e84a1.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Mastery \u2014 You Do Not Gain It. You Become It.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/b42aa5846665fb1ca678f59e084e84a1.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Prestige lies <strong>Mastery</strong> \u2014 five attributes (<i>Power, Production, Economy, Prestige, Resonance</i>) and five abilities that permanently reshape your Foundry. Mastery is not a skill. It is identity. Five paths \u2014 but all paths lead to the same destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/d58af4a0c940c66f7d37ce0676ea2192.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>New Game+ \u2014 Infinite Cycles of Ascension</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/d58af4a0c940c66f7d37ce0676ea2192.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset everything. Keep what matters. Gain compound multipliers that stack across infinite cycles. Unlock <strong>5 NG+ Abilities</strong> \u2014 Omega Strike, Infinite Flow, Zero Point Energy, Prestige Cascade, Harmonic Infinity \u2014 and at Cycle 5, activate <strong>Auto-Prestige</strong> to shatter the boundary between player and perpetual creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/bf0a82c8cdfddbda0c9d5c100e47a155.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Astral Boost &amp; Roguelite Cards</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/bf0a82c8cdfddbda0c9d5c100e47a155.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice generators to infuse them with <strong>Astral Essence</strong> \u2014 concentrated possibility that elevates production beyond ordinary limits. Then test your nerve with the <strong>Card System</strong>: draw from <strong>cosmic cards</strong> offering massive bonuses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]) balanced against real penalties. Timing and strategy define the bold Creator from the reckless one.[/p]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/5108f141d1a688b1cef3811e0687c62e.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Minigames \u2014 Break the Cycle</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/5108f141d1a688b1cef3811e0687c62e.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Foundry holds worlds within worlds. Step away from the production line into <strong>minigames</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Blaster</strong> \u2014 Twin-stick shooter against rogue nano-cubes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Garden</strong> \u2014 Plant seeds, harvest crystals, brew potions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Inspector</strong> \u2014 Quality control under shifting regulations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver Run</strong> \u2014 High-speed logistics action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Jump</strong> \u2014 Auto-run platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucky Cube</strong> \u2014 Roguelite slot machine with charms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Souls</strong> \u2014 Dark action roguelike</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win minigames to earn <strong>Potions</strong> \u2014 types across 4 tiers (Time Skip, CPS Boost, Cost Reduce, and more) that persist across Prestige and NG+ cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/20c777d96ed555095966256f5b9f0ea8.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>81+ Lore Fragments \u2014 The Architects Are Watching</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/20c777d96ed555095966256f5b9f0ea8.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across milestones and secrets lie <strong>lore fragments</strong>. Uncover the truth about the Five Architects who observe your ascension \u2014 the Observer, the Cultivator, the Transformer, the Destroyer, the Transcendent \u2014 and the forbidden whisper of a Sixth who discovered something that should not have been found. Behind it all lurks <strong>The Dreamer</strong>, a hypothesis about the being behind existence itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/fe20396d4a25e7a5adaa65216c2692a3.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Features</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/fe20396d4a25e7a5adaa65216c2692a3.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong> (synced to Steam) tracking every facet of your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Autobuyer System</strong> \u2014 Configure automation for generators and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overclock</strong> \u2014 Temporary production surges on cooldown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harmony System</strong> \u2014 Cross-system synergy bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events</strong> \u2014 Dynamic temporary bonuses during gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 Languages</strong> \u2014 EN, IT, FR, DE, ES, PT, JA, KO, ZH, RU, PL, TR, NL</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Creation is its own reward.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Void is waiting. The Foundry is ready. <strong>Click.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Big Mistake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722890/217621325ae68424c09bfc680ad9fdc6e4b95693.jpg"},{"name":"First Taps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722890/11f408b1df783a041a1d55cd45e92ff45bbf2096.jpg"},{"name":"Serial Clicker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722890/a5d39c91b06b7b4e479fec94bf24a52f14ee4599.jpg"},{"name":"Nimble Fingers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722890/c97b6f1773e49bfe1a5e4b3cb3c001095834e4bc.jpg"},{"name":"Click Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722890/4fa140947c065a44221be7110acb0bc08fab90ae.jpg"},{"name":"Click Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722890/00ac721b81fc8f0d2cfd03c1ec8316038833edc6.jpg"},{"name":"Cube Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722890/74976026cd720ece810e12ee1f65452dd7d384b1.jpg"},{"name":"Cube Billionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722890/aab59a48819e5f2a03c53ad186cbd6fd67be60bd.jpg"},{"name":"Reality Warped","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722890/65a08b4b1e445c415b95048fd4b7332ec445a540.jpg"},{"name":"Lightbringer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722890/6e3e20a5da2658789ddfe553873bddbaab32f24c.jpg"}],"total":100},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722890?t=1773972126","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722890?t=1773972126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/25d3c27f5e4e7b20b0c512c262081a81af440656/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773972126","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/25d3c27f5e4e7b20b0c512c262081a81af440656/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773972126","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/9c6d95d4f1cb42593fa679178c698778.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/d58af4a0c940c66f7d37ce0676ea2192.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/e5ed5d392b2677ea712440b903969a07.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/5108f141d1a688b1cef3811e0687c62e.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/33bf1232bedb163822700c8e6d47247a.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/b42aa5846665fb1ca678f59e084e84a1.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/fe20396d4a25e7a5adaa65216c2692a3.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;<strong><u>In the beginning was the Void. Then came the Click. Then came everything</u></strong>.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/7074efb7e1d3beb53e625816085ff645.avif?t=1773972126\" width=420 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Foundry</strong> is an incremental game built on cosmic mythology. Before time or thought existed, a single act of creation \u2014 a Click \u2014 shattered infinite stillness and forged the First Cube. Six faces, twelve edges, eight vertices: each encoding fundamental laws of reality. From one came two, from two came four, and from four came the cascade of all existence. Now <strong>you</strong> stand at the Foundry \u2014 a nexus point in creation itself \u2014 and the Architects are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/e5ed5d392b2677ea712440b903969a07.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>The First Click \u2014 and the Cascade That Follows</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/e5ed5d392b2677ea712440b903969a07.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click echoes the original act of creation. Build combo multipliers up to <strong>10x</strong>, trigger critical hits, and feel the rhythm of a universe expanding beneath your fingertips. But a Creator cannot click forever \u2014 that is why the Foundry builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command <strong>generators</strong> across escalating tiers, from the humble <i>Assembler Static</i> to the transcendent <i>Godforge Terminus</i> and the incomprehensible <i>Dimensional Nexus</i>. Each machine is a step along the <strong>Eight Ages of Ascension</strong> \u2014 from Assembly, through Synthesis and Transcendence, to Omnipotence and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/9c6d95d4f1cb42593fa679178c698778.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Upgrades \u2014 Choose Your Path Through Creation</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/9c6d95d4f1cb42593fa679178c698778.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Foundry does not reward brute force alone. Over <strong>500 upgrades</strong> branch across <strong>20+ specialization paths</strong> with layered prerequisites. Amplify your clicks, empower specific generators, or unlock synergies that fuse active and passive income into something greater. Every choice shapes the Creator you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/33bf1232bedb163822700c8e6d47247a.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Prestige \u2014 Metamorphosis, Not Loss</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/33bf1232bedb163822700c8e6d47247a.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The caterpillar does not mourn its cocoon. Why do you mourn your Cubes?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your production eclipses mortal scale, the Foundry offers <strong>Prestige</strong> \u2014 a metamorphosis. Sacrifice cubes and generators to earn <strong>Prestige Points</strong> and unlock <strong>187 permanent upgrades</strong> across multiple tiers. Your mastery and knowledge carry forward. Each cycle begins faster, climbs higher, reaches further. The first Prestige is fear. The tenth is routine. The hundredth is... something else entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/b42aa5846665fb1ca678f59e084e84a1.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Mastery \u2014 You Do Not Gain It. You Become It.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/b42aa5846665fb1ca678f59e084e84a1.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Prestige lies <strong>Mastery</strong> \u2014 five attributes (<i>Power, Production, Economy, Prestige, Resonance</i>) and five abilities that permanently reshape your Foundry. Mastery is not a skill. It is identity. Five paths \u2014 but all paths lead to the same destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/d58af4a0c940c66f7d37ce0676ea2192.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>New Game+ \u2014 Infinite Cycles of Ascension</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/d58af4a0c940c66f7d37ce0676ea2192.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset everything. Keep what matters. Gain compound multipliers that stack across infinite cycles. Unlock <strong>5 NG+ Abilities</strong> \u2014 Omega Strike, Infinite Flow, Zero Point Energy, Prestige Cascade, Harmonic Infinity \u2014 and at Cycle 5, activate <strong>Auto-Prestige</strong> to shatter the boundary between player and perpetual creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/bf0a82c8cdfddbda0c9d5c100e47a155.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Astral Boost &amp; Roguelite Cards</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/bf0a82c8cdfddbda0c9d5c100e47a155.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice generators to infuse them with <strong>Astral Essence</strong> \u2014 concentrated possibility that elevates production beyond ordinary limits. Then test your nerve with the <strong>Card System</strong>: draw from <strong>cosmic cards</strong> offering massive bonuses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b]) balanced against real penalties. Timing and strategy define the bold Creator from the reckless one.[/p]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/5108f141d1a688b1cef3811e0687c62e.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Minigames \u2014 Break the Cycle</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/5108f141d1a688b1cef3811e0687c62e.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Foundry holds worlds within worlds. Step away from the production line into <strong>minigames</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Blaster</strong> \u2014 Twin-stick shooter against rogue nano-cubes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Garden</strong> \u2014 Plant seeds, harvest crystals, brew potions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Inspector</strong> \u2014 Quality control under shifting regulations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver Run</strong> \u2014 High-speed logistics action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Jump</strong> \u2014 Auto-run platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucky Cube</strong> \u2014 Roguelite slot machine with charms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Souls</strong> \u2014 Dark action roguelike</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win minigames to earn <strong>Potions</strong> \u2014 types across 4 tiers (Time Skip, CPS Boost, Cost Reduce, and more) that persist across Prestige and NG+ cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/20c777d96ed555095966256f5b9f0ea8.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>81+ Lore Fragments \u2014 The Architects Are Watching</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/20c777d96ed555095966256f5b9f0ea8.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across milestones and secrets lie <strong>lore fragments</strong>. Uncover the truth about the Five Architects who observe your ascension \u2014 the Observer, the Cultivator, the Transformer, the Destroyer, the Transcendent \u2014 and the forbidden whisper of a Sixth who discovered something that should not have been found. Behind it all lurks <strong>The Dreamer</strong>, a hypothesis about the being behind existence itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/fe20396d4a25e7a5adaa65216c2692a3.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span><strong>Features</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/extras/fe20396d4a25e7a5adaa65216c2692a3.webp?t=1773972126\" width=24 height=24 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong> (synced to Steam) tracking every facet of your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Autobuyer System</strong> \u2014 Configure automation for generators and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overclock</strong> \u2014 Temporary production surges on cooldown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harmony System</strong> \u2014 Cross-system synergy bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events</strong> \u2014 Dynamic temporary bonuses during gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 Languages</strong> \u2014 EN, IT, FR, DE, ES, PT, JA, KO, ZH, RU, PL, TR, NL</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Creation is its own reward.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Void is waiting. The Foundry is ready. <strong>Click.</strong></p>","developers":["Jabran"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722890/465b883347e4b7fedeefcef74600f99d24c545d0/header.jpg?t=1773972126","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3722890/1710549007/854c9d489736679bb856cfb73ed14074fe821853/1771277360/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771278694","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3722890/1710549007/854c9d489736679bb856cfb73ed14074fe821853/1771277360/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771278694","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3722890/1710549007/854c9d489736679bb856cfb73ed14074fe821853/1771277360/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771278694","id":257288428,"name":"7 Steps","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257288428/e8f2f2608427302b28f6d37e114ebc2eb48f388f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771278694"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3722890/1891822806/0042011f82bb1a6aeb9624c5e332e66184a7f74c/1769822544/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771278695","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3722890/1891822806/0042011f82bb1a6aeb9624c5e332e66184a7f74c/1769822544/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771278695","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3722890/1891822806/0042011f82bb1a6aeb9624c5e332e66184a7f74c/